node_modules/
dist/
cache/*.json
.env

# Raw per-season backfill collection files (backfillRawStats*Historical.ts) -
# large (tens of MB), regenerable by re-running the collector script, and
# only ever needed locally to find which games clear a league's All-time
# bar. Never committed - only the small curated *HistoricalBarnBurners.json
# result (the handful of games that actually clear the bar) gets migrated
# into gameStore and committed. Standard going forward for every league's
# older-seasons backfill (James's explicit call, 2026-07-31), matching how
# NBA's own raw candidate files were never committed either.
data/*RawStats_*.json
